# The license key of Directus 12 for the integration suite (D-043, D-044). Copy this file to test/.env, which stays out
# of Git, and paste the key. DIRECTUS_LICENSE_KEY in the environment, as the CI sets it, wins over this file, and set
# to empty it runs Directus 12 on the Core tier.
#
# Without a key, Directus 12 runs on the Core tier, which refuses row permission rules: the tests that need them are
# skipped, and one test checks that the Core tier refuses them. With the key, every run reuses one activation of it.
DIRECTUS_LICENSE_KEY=
